        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Breach of Promise\n- People: Harold Huth, Clive Brook, Judy Campbell, C.V. France, Marguerite Allan, Percy Walsh, Jane Birkin, Andrew Birkin, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Lou Doillon, Anno Birkin, David Birkin, Kate Barry\n- Roles: director, actress, singer, screenwriter, artist, photographer, poet\n\nFacts:\n- Breach of Promise is a 1942 British romance film.\n- Harold Huth directed Breach of Promise.\n- Clive Brook, Judy Campbell, C.V. France, Marguerite Allan, and Percy Walsh starred in Breach of Promise.\n- Judy Campbell was the mother of actress and singer Jane Birkin and screenwriter and director Andrew Birkin.\n- Judy Campbell was the grandmother of actresses Charlotte Gainsbourg and Lou Doillon, poet Anno Birkin, artist David Birkin, and photographer Kate Barry.",
